WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:07,030
It seems that Uncle Xu and other residents have almost finished cleaning up.

2
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:14,810
They should be able to take care of the rest.

3
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:16,410
Why don't you go sit on the toilet?

4
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:17,810
Let me lie down for a while

5
00:00:17,810 --> 00:00:20,210
I'm really tired after a busy day

6
00:00:20,210 --> 00:00:29,090
Big project, right?

7
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:31,090
Although I recognize your work attitude

8
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:33,490
But trading is just your job

9
00:00:33,490 --> 00:00:35,090
Not a big project

10
00:00:35,090 --> 00:00:38,140
Say I am not a big project

11
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,140
Then look what this is

12
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:43,410
What other drawings did you buy?

13
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:45,150
You give it to me

14
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:46,580
I'll tell you

15
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:48,780
After all, I have a big project now

16
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:51,180
You should have the most comfortable spot in the room

17
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,080
It's impossible for Tang Yi to give it up to you

18
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:54,880
The most I can do is let you sit in my arms
